Peter,

As we head into this final stretch, I wanted to reach out to thank you for everything you&rsquo;ve helped us accomplish.
https://click.email.judgejoeforcongress.com/?qs=cf86390fc711a73d9a69ac7229b8a224e52a9daeabcf5db72953679b7137a8fb9d31d2c2327f7d2b9138b7baa0003f917c61d15d277288e9c812d42b78957806

I&rsquo;m running in one of the toughest House races in the country that&rsquo;s a top pick up opportunity for Republicans.

Without your support, we would not have gotten to where we are today.

Your support, whether you joined my team at the start of my campaign or in the past few weeks has not gone unnoticed.

Whether it&rsquo;s helping us fill up the campaign car with gas, funding our get out the vote efforts, or helping us keep ads on the air, your support has gone a long way.

https://click.email.judgejoeforcongress.com/?qs=cf86390fc711a73d9a69ac7229b8a224e52a9daeabcf5db72953679b7137a8fb9d31d2c2327f7d2b9138b7baa0003f917c61d15d277288e9c812d42b78957806

Now, with just 4 days left to go, we&rsquo;re in the final stretch.

There is so much at stake in this election. Crime is out of control, grocery prices are burdening families, and the border crisis is wreaking havoc across our country including right here in Illinois.

Winning this race isn&rsquo;t just about flipping IL-17 RED. It&rsquo;s about sending a leader to Washington who will listen to your concerns, be your voice in Congress, and fight for you.

I&rsquo;m ready to get to work, but in order to win this race, I am hoping to get your help one more time.
https://click.email.judgejoeforcongress.com/?qs=cf86390fc711a73d9a69ac7229b8a224e52a9daeabcf5db72953679b7137a8fb9d31d2c2327f7d2b9138b7baa0003f917c61d15d277288e9c812d42b78957806
If you are able to step up before Election Day in just 4 days to help fund our final get out the vote efforts, I would be especially grateful.

Thank you again for all of your help and support.

Thank you,

Judge Joe McGraw

